{"id":"51d27680f14ff922","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree.md","title":"ZFC Desc Sacks Tree","display":"df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree — ZFC Desc Sacks Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree — ZFC Desc Sacks Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree — ZFC Desc Sacks Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (binary tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\)</span> (perfect-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SacksTree}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SacksTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{SacksTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{SacksTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Sacks condition is a perfect subtree of the binary tree. The canonical perfect-tree predicate already contains the binary-tree and pruning conditions, so they are not duplicated here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S$ (perfect-tree predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SacksTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{SacksTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)","display":true}],"bytes":873,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1798","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree.md|58-df-zfc-desc-sacks-tree]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["aba489b7551a80b3"]}